 **Data Structures:**
-1.  **Edit Grid ($E$):** A 3D voxel grid of resolution $128^3$ [S1]. It acts as a bitfield where bits are set to 1 for voxels containing selected content. It is a subset of the occupancy grid $O$ from Instant-NGP [S1].
